+``django.contrib.auth``
+~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
+
+.. versionadded:: 4.2.16
+
+Log messages related to :doc:`contrib/auth`, particularly ``ERROR`` messages
+are generated when a :class:`~django.contrib.auth.forms.PasswordResetForm` is
